{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/extras/d41fd7d8210b79a3547a04d2c834fd15.poster.avif?t=1774248516\" width=478 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/extras/d41fd7d8210b79a3547a04d2c834fd15.webm?t=1774248516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/extras/d41fd7d8210b79a3547a04d2c834fd15.mp4?t=1774248516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket-jump using explosive fireballs, unlock abilities and master an ever-growing movement system. After descending into a broken underworld, you must learn to traverse Satan Hill. Explore the non-linear corners of the underworld, find secrets, defeat demons and reclaim the Eye of Evil.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 secret items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 golden keys</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/extras/62e292c03a00ce9b889a946d066d84a5.poster.avif?t=1774248516\" width=478 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/extras/62e292c03a00ce9b889a946d066d84a5.webm?t=1774248516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737610/extras/62e292c03a00ce9b889a946d066d84a5.mp4?t=1774248516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master movement</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragr